From 965e09b61edf4d9f9cb33ae515093698af14acf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:38:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(app): library eprintln! diagnostics become tracing
 events

Twelve ad-hoc eprintln! in camcraft-app (Top/stock, carried stock, drill
prior, rapid law, stock view, rotary verdict, playback worker, kinds,
STEP import, model transform, MCP bridge) are tracing warn/error events;
a test pins that a limit refusal names the limit at warn. Subscriber
already writes stderr, so MCP stdout stays clean.

Refs #163

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
